WEBVTT

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:37.950
Dreams are the wind

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:45.650
Guiding light

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:50.130
The sky and clouds...

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.240
Meg-chan.

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:53.840
Not eating again?

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:55.620
Does it not taste very good?

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:58.150
You didn't like something?

00:01:59.030 --> 00:02:00.980
You have to eat properly.

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:02.130
It's okay.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:05.600
No matter what I eat, 
it's not like it'll cure me.

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:07.740
The IV is enough.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:10.480
There you go again.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.870
At this rate, even curable conditions
won't be cured.

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:16.880
Accurately speaking,
incurable conditions are incurable.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.080
Why do you say such things?

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:20.380
It's the truth though.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:24.220
But you know, I think it just
depends on how you look at it.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:29.180
You see, my current situation
really appeals to me.

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:32.630
It's incredibly literary 
and beautiful, you know?

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:36.630
I couldn't defile my body 
with food like this.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:41.120
The sweet fruit called Death
that you'll only get to taste once...

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:44.700
That temptation is always 
right before my eyes.

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.240
Sublime, don't you think?

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:48.720
You're beyond me.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:49.980
You can't.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:54.620
If you close the window,
the angel won't be able to get in.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:56.480
The angel?

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:57.840
Yes.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:00.940
Someday, when my body's been cleansed...

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:02.710
...the angel will come for me.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.230
An absolutely pure angel...

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:17.500
Angel

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:23.240
That girl declined to 
eat her food again.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:25.030
And she's always looking outside.

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:26.510
Oh, it's the church.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.820
Isn't that thing kind of creepy?

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:31.790
They're tearing it down soon.

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:34.090
Maybe she's capable of seeing something.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:35.120
Stop that.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.680
When will you come for me?

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:11.530
God...

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.210
No, maybe it should 
be the Grim Reaper...

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.040
Take me away soon.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.060
To the empty darkness.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:41.490
Who's there?

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.290
Is someone there?

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:51.030
What?

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.510
An angel?

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:50.030
Have you come?

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:51.760
For me?

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:12.510
Please, take me away.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:19.950
I don't want to stay here anymore.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:27.800
Please...

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.860
I-It's hot.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.770
It's a little high.

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:24.280
You need to rest quietly.

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:25.330
All right.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:28.050
And eat your meals properly.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:28.780
All right.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.280
That's a good girl.

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:35.540
Well, I'll see you later.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:36.520
All right.

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:48.330
You can come out now, Miss Angel.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:59.840
I've been telling you 
that I'm not an angel.

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:03.500
I know.
 You're Suigintou, right?

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.680
But in my eyes,
 you're an angel.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:11.380
A black angel, come to take my life.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:17.460
Forced into a covenant,
and my medium turns out like this.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:20.560
Not to mention she's dying 
and has no strength.

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:23.770
Would you like some apple?

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:30.050
About what we were 
talking about before...

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:33.320
When this Alice Game thing starts...

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:36.710
...you're going to use my life
to fight this Shinku, right?

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:38.940
Not really.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:43.540
I can defeat Shinku without having
to use your strength.

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:47.320
I don't require a medium 
to begin with anyway.

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:50.030
I don't like that.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:52.140
Use it up all at once.

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:53.560
Stop this heartbeat.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:57.560
Okay?

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.130
You really want to die?

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:00.420
Yes.

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:06.610
Sorry, but there's no guarantee
your wish will come true.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:13.860
The last time I saw Shinku,
it was 580,000 hours ago...

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:47.510
We rarely awaken together 
at the same time.

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:51.920
Though I've awakened,
 if someone else is still asleep...

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.990
...the Alice Game will not begin.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:55.920
I see.

00:09:57.980 --> 00:10:00.480
Well, just don't get your hopes up.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.670
What a boring city.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:55.700
This sensation...

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:16.720
It was 586,920 hours ago 
that we fought here.

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.370
I...

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:30.370
I fought here... with Shinku...

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:41.630
Shinku!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:12:59.200
Who's there?

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:01.200
Who's there...

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:02.930
Show yourself!

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:05.500
Show yourself...

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:12.910
You're...

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:15.880
Bara-Suishou.

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:19.420
The seventh Rozen Maiden doll.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:20.920
The seventh?

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:36.840
It seems you're an insolent 
younger sister too.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.330
This power...

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:54.780
Strong...

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:11.070
This... This is...

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:18.040
It can't be...

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.140
Yes.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:26.150
I was turned into junk then...

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:29.650
You were turned into junk once.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:34.170
I lost to Shinku?

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.160
You lost.

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.010
Then how...

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.900
The only one capable of repairing
Rozen Maidens...

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:48.270
...is Father.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.140
Father did?

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:52.660
For the Alice Game.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.210
Hold on!

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:04.770
Father did...

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.620
There's no mistake.

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:30.760
That time, I was...

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.620
Did Father...

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.920
really... do that for me?

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.540
Father...

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:49.530
Suigintou?

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.180
Thank you.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:56.770
You used my life, didn't you?

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.720
I knew right away.

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:05.210
The ring became hot, and
I felt like my heart was burning.

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.070
The ring?

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:19.160
The doctor did unneeded things,
so I didn't get to die though.

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:23.600
You really are dying.

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:26.660
To be reduced to this 
state after so little.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.200
Yes.

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:33.120
At first, I was told I would only live
to the age of 5.

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:35.860
But I didn't die.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.140
Next, it was to the age of 7.

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:41.150
After that, 10.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:44.400
In time, everyone got tired.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:46.680
But of course they would.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:51.420
No matter how prolonged,
it didn't change the fact I'd die soon.

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:55.430
That's why I think it'd be 
better if I went quickly.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:59.530
This part of me is a 
piece of garbage anyway.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.030
Piece of garbage?

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:04.530
Right. I'm not complete.

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:07.040
I'm a broken girl.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:09.580
Junk...

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.240
Junk?

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.280
You're right, junk.

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:17.000
I'm not perfect like you.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.740
Of course not.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:22.290
Because I'm the perfect doll,
who is to become Alice.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:24.320
Right.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:55.140
So you have appeared again.

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:57.820
But I will not be 
troubled by you anymore.

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.200
You no longer exist.

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:01.790
Begone!

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:04.080
Shinku...

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:14.790
It cannot be...

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:18.060
Surprised, Shinku?

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:22.110
You thought you had 
defeated me that easily?

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:24.310
You really are such a dummy.

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:27.310
Are you... really...

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.620
If you just idly stand 
there, I'll tear you to...

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:34.870
Suigintou...

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:38.700
It really is you, isn't it?

00:18:42.410 --> 00:18:43.740
Thank goodness.

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:45.930
So Father really...

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:47.620
Of course!

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:50.240
I'm the most worthy
of becoming Alice!

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:53.670
That's why Father revived me.

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:00.410
Shinku...

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:03.950
Thank goodness.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:06.650
Suigintou...

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:11.460
Well, that's fine.

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:14.660
I'll let you off with just 
a greeting for today.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:19.420
But the next time we meet, 
I'll turn you into junk.

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:23.680
I'll tear you into so many pieces
you'll never be able to return.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.380
Wait.

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.980
I've wanted to say something 
to you all this time.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:42.350
That I was wrong for calling 
you a piece of junk.

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:50.580
Seeing Jun restore a lost stuffed doll
and my right arm made me realize.

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:55.970
As long as you heed the voice calling,
no one will turn into junk.

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:59.520
None of us are junk to begin with.

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:03.970
We all have the radiance making us
worthy of becoming Alice.

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:07.840
So I am sorry.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:25.890
Happiness and...

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:34.060
...unpleasant memories

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:38.740
Welcome back.

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:42.710
Sing the rest.

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:45.550
There's no point in hearing it.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:51.050
Because I'm junk, right?

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:57.260
Say, is the Alice Game...

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:58.480
Junk is not...

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:02.760
Junk is not something 
you should talk about.

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:12.090
The gentle present

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:15.680
grows distant

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:21.080
May the quiet night go on

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:29.140
Putting it all into the moment

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:37.030
Discarding the desire to hold on

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:41.470
May every thought

00:21:41.470 --> 00:21:45.040
be joined

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:56.940
So you're back.

00:21:57.520 --> 00:21:58.180
So?

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:02.060
How did it seem with her?

00:22:03.190 --> 00:22:07.290
All is going according to plan.

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:43.980
Jun. Jun.

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.260
What do you want so 
early in the morning?

00:23:46.410 --> 00:23:47.560
I tried making some tea.

00:23:47.950 --> 00:23:49.070
Would you like some as well?

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:52.250
I also tried cleaning the room.

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:53.260
W-What the...?

00:23:53.720 --> 00:23:57.390
Oh, Hina-Ichigo,
 you can use the shelf as you like.

00:23:57.550 --> 00:24:00.100
Shinku's lost it...

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.610
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:03.900 --> 00:24:06.960
Its melody is like a dream.

00:24:04.160 --> 00:24:10.850
Chapter 7
Tea Party
